# Thin CPI

- One generic OData iFlow: destination + service + entity + query options in → raw JSON out.
- No LLM, rate limit, cache, intent, or BO catalog in the iFlow.
- Prefer calling SAP Business Accelerator Hub sandbox Destination during trial.
